        "- [His repo](https://github.com/instructkr/claw-code) hit [50K stars in 2 hours]{.alert} 🚀\n",
        "- Anthropic had built \"Undercover Mode\" to stop Claude from leaking secrets. [Then a human leaked their own code]{.alert} 🤦🏻‍♂️\n",
        ":::\n",
